    "title": "Lady Generals fall to Rappahannock - NewsBreak",
    "text": "altavistajournal.com\nwebsite\nWarsaw\nLady Generals fall to Rappahannock\n14 hours ago\nThe William Campbell softball team’s postseason journey took them on the road this past Monday (June 9) as they battled Rappahannock in the Class 1 State Softball Quarterfinals. The Lady Generals found themselves in the middle of a true pitcher’s duel between Peighton Francis and Lady Raiders hurler Avery Brann. Rappahannock scored the only run of the game in the bottom of the sixth inning on a sac fly by third baseman Cameron Nash to edge William Campbell 1-0.",
